                    "type": "math",
                    "latex": "\\begin{align*}(2x+1)+(2x+3)+(2x+5)&=(2x+2)+(2x+4)+23\\\\6x+9&=4x+29\\\\2x&=20\\\\x&=10\\end{align*}",
